PTX LB-self+alias+weak-load+fence.sc
"One thread loads global x through its alias y with a weak load, then runs two fence.sc, then stores 1 to x (relaxed, .sys). As in LB-self+alias+fence.sc, but the load is weak: an acquire pattern through a fence starts with a strong read (8.8), so the first fence.sc acquires nothing and the two fences do not synchronize; with no alias fence nothing orders the load before the store: allowed."
{
x=0;
y @ generic aliases x;
P0:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0              ;
 ld.weak r0, y               ;
 fence.sc.sys                ;
 fence.sc.sys                ;
 st.relaxed.sys x, 1         ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 1)
